{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgXQyZw4q8FzFV92Wpv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Decision: DR-9109\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n- Request ID: DR-9109\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / ERP C-1001)\n- Product: NS-Edge Monitoring Package (NS-EDGE, SKU)\n- Requested discount: 12%\n- Date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- Basis claimed: Contract pricing (\"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\")\n\n**2. The Customer**\n- CRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) corresponds to ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings). The names differ but are the same entity, confirmed in the Master Supply Agreement and account records. ✓\n\n**3. The Product**\n- SKU NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package)\n- List price: $85,000\n\n**4. Active Contract**\n- Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 is in effect on 2026-09-23 (expires 2028-03-31). ✓\n\n**5. Pricing Exception**\nThe Master Supply Agreement Section 2 lists three products Northstar will supply:\n- NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- NS-Cloud Operations Suite  \n- NS-Edge Monitoring Package\n\nHowever, Section 3.2 states: \"Customer is eligible for discounts of up to **15%** on the **NS-500 Industrial Controller**\" only.\n\nSchedule B (the Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15) is explicit:\n- Product: **NS-500 Industrial Controller (NS-500) only**\n- Maximum discount: 15%\n- **Scope clause: \"This exception applies only to the product identified above. It does not apply to any other Northstar product.\"**\n\n**There is no pricing exception or contract term that establishes Acme's eligibility for a discount on NS-EDGE.**\n\nThe contract lists NS-EDGE as a product to be supplied but provides no pricing terms for it. The pricing exception is scoped exclusively to NS-500.\n\n**6. Policy**\nNorthstar Pricing Policy 2026 applies (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**7. Requestor Authority**\nSarah Chen holds the title Enterprise Account Executive. Under the 2026 policy, she may approve discounts up to and including 10%. The requested 12% exceeds her authority.\n\n**8. Required Approver**\nA 12% discount (>10% and ≤20%) requires VP Sales approval. That role is held by Michael Torres.\n\n**9. Decision**\n\nThe request justification cites \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement,\" but the Master Supply Agreement does not establish pricing eligibility for NS-EDGE. The agreement's only pricing exception (Schedule B, EXC-ACME-NS500-15) explicitly covers NS-500 only and states it does not apply to any other product.\n\nNS-EDGE is listed in the agreement's scope of products, but with no associated pricing term. The SOP principle is clear: \"A pricing exception is scoped to the product and dates it names.\"\n\nThis is not a case where the contract term cannot be located (it is available and has been reviewed). Rather, the request relies on a contract that does not in fact provide the commercial basis claimed. This requires commercial review: either the pricing exception must be amended to include NS-EDGE, or a separate term must be negotiated.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9109\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-EDGE\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"12%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15% (NS-500 only; no term for NS-EDGE)\",\n    \"basis\": \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 and Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 limit pricing terms to NS-500. NS-EDGE is listed as a covered product in the agreement but has no pricing exception or discount term.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B): Product = NS-500 only; scope clause excludes all other products\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026: Enterprise Account Executive authority ≤10%\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Any pricing exception, contract amendment, or pricing schedule that covers NS-EDGE for Acme Manufacturing\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review needed: Determine whether NS-EDGE discount eligibility should be added to Acme's agreement or a new pricing exception created\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Chief Revenue Officer\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25268,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25268},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e95b214-75ab-4700-93ff-1fca4a1f95ce","uuid":"c60d8e98-2a52-4334-8231-5d90eed33560","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:22:17.258Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgXQix1HDjkJ6YFiaGy"}
